Android libcore java.util.zip compatibility reference

The ZipFile and ZipEntry behavior in lib/engine/dalvik/java_zip.dart was
implemented with reference to Android 5.0.0_r1 libcore (Apache Harmony lineage),
licensed under Apache License 2.0. The referenced source carries the Apache
Software Foundation contributor-license notice. See LICENSE in this directory.

Reference files:
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/libcore/+/android-5.0.0_r1/luni/src/main/java/java/util/zip/ZipFile.java
https://android.googlesource.com/platform/libcore/+/android-5.0.0_r1/luni/src/main/java/java/util/zip/ZipEntry.java

This Dart implementation supports the original APK's ZIP32 stored/deflated
entries. It adds explicit CRC checking, rejects unsupported ZIP64/encryption,
and materializes entry streams in memory. These are documented implementation
choices, not claims that every Java ZIP API is implemented.
